      <h2 id="re-running-scans_oc-compliance-plug-in-understanding" class="group scroll-mt-20">Re-running scans<a href="#re-running-scans_oc-compliance-plug-in-understanding" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Although it is possible to run scans as scheduled jobs, you must often re-run a scan on demand, particularly after remediations are applied or when other changes to the cluster are made.</p>
      <p>Rerunning a scan with the Compliance Operator requires the use of an annotation on the scan object. However, with the <code>oc-compliance</code> plugin you can rerun a scan with a single command.</p>
